<Base title="Support" lang="en" description="Help with LISA Cloud, your Mac connection, purchases, and account deletion.">
  <h1>LISA Support</h1>
  <p>LISA is your personal AI assistant. Choose LISA Cloud to sign in without a Mac, or connect your own Mac running LISA.</p>
  <h2>Sign in and connect</h2>
  <p>In Lisa Pocket, select Settings → LISA Cloud. Use Apple, Google when available, or an email sign-in code. Existing password accounts can expand “Use a password instead”. Choose My Mac to scan the pairing code from your Mac. Both connections are saved separately; conversations are not automatically copied between them.</p>
  <h2>Credits and purchases</h2>
  <p>After cloud sign-in, open Settings → LISA account → Add credits. Purchases are consumable AI usage credits. If a payment completed but credits did not arrive, sign in to the same account and reopen the app. Contact us with the transaction identifier; never send a password, sign-in code, or full receipt publicly.</p>
  <h2>Account and data</h2>
  <p>To delete your cloud account, open Settings → LISA account → Delete account. Unpairing a Mac only removes that connection from the phone. Read our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> before sharing data with AI services.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:wangharp@gmail.com">wangharp@gmail.com</a> for account, purchase, or privacy requests. Report non-sensitive bugs on <a href="https://github.com/oratis/LISA/issues">GitHub</a>. Include the app version, connection mode and steps to reproduce.</p>
</Base>
